The FirnR package as a whole is distributed under GPL (>= 3). The FirnR
package includes other open source software components. The following
is a list of these components:

* paleospec.AvgToBin: Code adapted from function AvgToBin
  in package paleospec: MIT
* paleospec.ApplyFilter: Code adapted from function ApplyFilter
  in package paleospec: MIT
* ColorPal: Code taken from function ColorPal in package grfxtools: GPL (>= 3)
